			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Grimesilt was an excavation of the dwarves of {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}, dug into the eastern gorge by men who hoped to find the secrets of the burned land. The {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} took it from them. Their geologists now work the pit, and they are said to use a strange magic in their labors. Of the Ironforge team, little remains. One wounded {link:dwarves}dwarf{/link} was found at the bottom of the dig, and another survives only because he hid in an outhouse and was locked in. It was at Grimesilt that the stones called Suntara were first found.]=],
