		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Thorium Brotherhood is a fellowship of Dark Iron dwarves who have broken with their kin in {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock Mountain{/link}. They left the halls of the Depths of their own will, and they insist that they are nothing like the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} who still serve {red:ragnaros}Ragnaros{/red}. They are miners and smiths first of all, and their smiths are said to be among the finest in the world. Of late, their Overseer admits, they have had to become soldiers as well.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Thorium Point",
			text = [=[The Brotherhood's seat is {link:thorium-point}Thorium Point{/link}, a fortified town on the cliffs above {link:the-cauldron}the Cauldron{/link}. From there they watch every movement of the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} in the gorge. They post bounties on their former kin, pay for the return of stolen tools, and hire outsiders to do the killing that they have too few hands to do themselves.]=],
