		{
			title = "Secrets of the Forge",
			text = [=[The Brotherhood guards its craft closely. Its recipe for fiery flux is a treasured secret, and when a traitor carried it off to the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link}, the smiths of {link:thorium-point}Thorium Point{/link} wanted it back at any cost. It is said that the Brotherhood knows how to forge the arms and armor of the Firelord himself, but lacks the strength to gather what such work would need. Those who earn its trust are sent to Lokhtos Darkbargainer, the Brotherhood's agent inside {red:blackrock-depths}Blackrock Depths{/red}.]=],
